    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When a critical power generation equipment failure triggered an equipment failure, the grid management authority faced a massive power deficit to overcome. The decisive crisis managers stepped in, ordering an emergency load shedding to keep a critical transmission line from overloading, a courageous decision to prevent total collapse. This action addressed the significant loss of generation capacity, leaving more than 950 megawatts unavailable as a high-level warning was issued across the frontline of the power crisis.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "result-0",
          "how-2",
          "why-0"
        ],
        "center": "result-0",
        "center_kind": "result",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The unit's unexpected shutdown, an equipment malfunction within the energy infrastructure, acted as the triggering event for the crisis. This power outage set off a chain of grid management actions, from the alert declaration to the operational procedure to avoid overload. The result was a substantial reduction in available electricity, a power shortage impacting the region.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "why-0",
        "center_kind": "why",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 3
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.72
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Faced with compounding system vulnerabilities and the relentless assault of summer demand, the authorities declared a red alert for the Visayas region. This grid management action, a definitive emergency response, was their first move to stabilize the grid after the critical system failure of a power unit. The point of initial failure left electricity production facilities weakened, creating a high demand situation that threatened the entire energy sector entity.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Hero",
        "fragments": [
          "how-1",
          "why-1",
          "why-0"
        ],
