        "kind": "persona-semantic",
        "source_elements": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "search_text": "The unit's unexpected shutdown, an equipment malfunction within the energy infrastructure, acted as the triggering event for the crisis. This power outage set off a chain of grid management actions, from the alert declaration to the operational procedure to avoid overload. The result was a substantial reduction in available electricity, a power shortage impacting the region.",
