        "kind": "persona-semantic",
        "source_elements": [
          "how-1",
          "why-1",
          "why-0"
        ],
        "search_text": "Faced with compounding system vulnerabilities and the relentless assault of summer demand, the authorities declared a red alert for the Visayas region. This grid management action, a definitive emergency response, was their first move to stabilize the grid after the critical system failure of a power unit. The point of initial failure left electricity production facilities weakened, creating a high demand situation that threatened the entire energy sector entity.",
